# 6. Leave Request State Machine

The only valid states are:

```text
PENDING_MANAGER
PENDING_HR
APPROVED
REJECTED
ESCALATED
CANCEL_REQUESTED
CANCELLED
```

Normal flow:

```text
Employee submits
      ↓
PENDING_MANAGER
      ↓
Manager approves
      ↓
PENDING_HR
      ↓
HR approves
      ↓
APPROVED
```

Rejection:

```text
PENDING_MANAGER → REJECTED
PENDING_HR → REJECTED
```

Escalation:

```text
PENDING_MANAGER
      ↓
Timeout
      ↓
ESCALATED
```

Cancellation:

```text
APPROVED
    ↓
CANCEL_REQUESTED
    ↓
CANCELLED
```

## Critical Rule

Do not allow arbitrary status changes.

Create a dedicated:

```text
LeaveStateMachineService
```

Every transition must validate:

* Current state
* Actor
* Actor role
* Requested action
* Business rules

Never allow controllers to directly set a request status.

