# 16. Leave Cancellation

Employees can request cancellation of eligible upcoming approved leave.

Expected flow:

```text
APPROVED
    ↓
CANCEL_REQUESTED
    ↓
CANCELLED
```

Business rules must determine whether additional approval is required.

When cancellation is finalized:

* Restore leave balance
* Update request state
* Create audit record
* Create notification

Never restore the balance twice.

